\item One-pager should cover general research question, how you would think about answering it, and some general design considerations.  You are not directly graded on the one-pager, but it allows us to give you feedback to make your final project better.
\item See Lecture 5 for design documents and pre-registrations.
\end{itemize}

\end{frame}


